# The ledger hashes the evaluation code to decide whether a trial is a repeat.
# With core.autocrlf a checkout rewrites line endings per platform, so the same
# commit hashed differently on Windows and on the Linux runner and no trial
# ever deduped across the two.  The hash normalises endings now, but the files
# themselves should stop churning as well: one commit, one set of bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.parquet binary
*.tar.gz binary
